{"topicSections":[{"title":"Records","anchor":"Records","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetKind"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"title":"LinkerSets","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"LinkerSets"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","externalID":"LinkerSets"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Declarations that register themselves at compile time and are found at run time across every module a program links.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/linkersets"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An attached macro emits a small record into a section LinkerSets owns, and a typed run-time API"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enumerates every record of one kind in a deterministic order. Each record carries a kind, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clients share the mechanism without seeing each other’s records. Failures are typed errors; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run-time API never traps."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A client tags its records with a kind of its own, four ASCII characters read as a 32-bit integer:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import LinkerSets","","extension LinkerSetKind {","    \/\/\/ Records of routes, `\"rout\"`.","    static let routes = LinkerSetKind(rawValue: 0x726F_7574)","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSetRecord":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"LinkerSetRecord","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkersetrecord","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"One entry in a linker set: a record an attached macro places in the section LinkerSets owns.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetRecord"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetRecord"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSet":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LinkerSet","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet","kind":"symbol","title":"LinkerSet","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every record of one kind, across every image the program has loaded, and the values they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produce."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LinkerSet","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSetKind":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetKind","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetKind"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetKind"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tag that says which client a linker-set record belongs to."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkersetkind","kind":"symbol","title":"LinkerSetKind"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"LinkerSets","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Declarations that register themselves at compile time and are found at run time across every module a program links.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets"}}}